  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/NUFDZAKS/4c2ae7ef695e568902814ab197689b922e530236_96.webp\" alt=\"Beltborne Lanterns 图标\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fbeltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://discord.gg/9JRb3JMAD3\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\" height=\"48\"> </a>&nbsp; <a style=\"text-decoration:none;border:0\" href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"48\"> </a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns?display_name=release&sort=semver&style=flat-square&color=00ae5d\" alt=\"最新版本\"></p>\n<h1>Beltborne Lanterns &mdash; 解放双手，照亮前路</h1>\n<p>手持灯笼时按下 <strong>B</strong> 键 &mdash; 它会扣在腰带上。行走、跳跃、战斗 &mdash; 灯笼会<strong>随物理效果摆动</strong>并<em>在你附近投下光亮。</em> 需要重新拿回手里？再次按下 <strong>B</strong> 即可。💡</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🧩 为什么它很棒</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一键操作，毫无麻烦。</strong> 再也不用翻背包了：<strong>B</strong> 可瞬间将灯笼装上或取下。</li>\n<li><strong>灵动之光。</strong> 物理效果让光芒更加真实 &mdash; 移动和转身时灯笼会轻轻摇曳。</li>\n<li><strong>沉浸体验，毫不妥协。</strong> 双手解放，光亮随行 &mdash; 探索、建造、生存。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚙️ 使用方法&nbsp;</h2>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">手持灯笼。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">按下 <strong>B</strong> &mdash; 它会固定在腰带上。</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">四处走动 &mdash; 它会随你一起摆动并<em>在你附近投下光亮。</em></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">再次按下 <strong>B</strong> &mdash; 它会从腰带上取下。<br><br></li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><em>动态光照说明：</em>游戏内光照效果需要安装动态光照模组 &mdash; 请参阅常见问题解答。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>⧉ 扩展插件</h2>\n<p><strong>Beltborne Lanterns - Accessories Layer</strong>：&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> / <a href=\"https://github.com/Shadscure/Beltborne-Lanterns-Accessories-Layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📷 展示</h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo1.webp\" alt=\"演示 1\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo2.webp\" alt=\"演示 2\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo3.webp\" alt=\"演示 3\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo4.webp\" alt=\"演示 4\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo5.webp\" alt=\"演示 5\" width=\"380\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/0xCoDSnet/Beltborne-Lanterns/refs/heads/1.21-architectury-loom/demo/demo6.webp\" alt=\"演示 6\" width=\"380\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<hr>\n<h2>❓ 常见问题 &mdash; 兼容性 &amp; 多人游戏</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>支持多人游戏吗？</strong> &mdash; <strong>支持！</strong><em>(客户端和服务器均需安装)</em></li>\n<li><strong>原版 Minecraft 中会发光吗？</strong> &mdash; <strong>不会。</strong> 请安装动态光照模组以使腰带灯笼发光：\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fabric / Quilt / NeoForge</strong>：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a></li>\n<li><strong>替代方案（NeoForge）</strong>：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Lights (AtomicStryker)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>能与灵魂灯笼兼容吗？</strong> &mdash; <strong>可以！</strong></li>\n<li><strong>能与其他模组的灯笼兼容吗？</strong> &mdash; <strong>可以！</strong> 请在配置文件中将其 <strong>物品标签</strong> 添加到兼容列表。</li>\n<li><strong>能与其他模组的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a> 兼容吗？ </strong>&mdash; <strong>可以</strong>，请安装 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbeltborne-lanterns-accessories-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Beltborne Lanterns: Accessories Layer</strong></a> 扩展插件。</li>\n<li><strong>能与其他模组的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffirst-person-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">First-person Model</a> 兼容吗？ </strong>&mdash;&nbsp;<strong>可以</strong>，而且效果非常棒！&nbsp;<em>(截图见下方折叠内容)</em>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/152920d7a3299d971640438bc0bbb7eaea029728.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>📜 许可证</h2>\n<p>本项目遵循 <strong>Apache License 2.0</strong> 许可证 &mdash; 详情请参阅 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beltborne-lanterns/settings/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LICENSE</a> 文件。<br>完整许可文本：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache 2.0</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">为 Minecraft 社区用心打造 ❤️</p>",
